      "role": "user",
      "content": "the raft metaphor feels like so much work though. just constant paddling against nothing. sometimes it feels like there's this peace in just... not fighting. like if i just stopped paddling, the water would finally be quiet. it feels more like an end to the struggle than a way to live.",
